<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-URUGUAY BEAT VENEZUELA 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-URUGUAY BEAT VENEZUELA 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>SUCRE, Bolivia 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguay beat Venezuela</p>
<p>2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a Copa America first round group B match</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Alvaro Recoba (18th minute), Marcelo Saralegui</p>
<p>(47)</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Bolivia	  2  2  0  0  2  0  6</p>
<p> Uruguay	  2  1  0  1  2  1  3</p>
<p> Peru	     2  1  0  1  1  2  3</p>
<p> Venezuela	2  0  0  2  0  3  0</p>
<p>Note: top two teams in each group plus the two best</p>
<p>third-placed teams qualify for the quarter-finals.</p>
</text>
